{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12656","headline":"系乐府十二首 谢大龟 · 元结","name":"系乐府十二首 谢大龟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"客来自江汉，云得双大龟。\n且言龟甚灵，问我君何疑。\n自昔保方正，顾尝无妄私。\n顺和固鄙分，全守真常规。\n行之恐不及，此外将何爲。\n惠恩如可谢，占问敢终辞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12656.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12656","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}